https://github.com/mohit67890/imajev/tree/318e8dad55c12a1c6faddbec5f30489d2ee529ff

This integration supports text choices with one option-order rotation and
rejects inputs outside the compiled candidate's limits. Model weights and the
compiled graph are not included. Review the model, base model, training data
and converted-asset terms before distributing assets separately.

